      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>[. . .] I sold the pepper for 25 dinars, </li>\n<li>which makes, for 24 bah\u0101rs of small measure, 600 </li>\n<li>Malik\u012b dinars; the \u2018refurbished\u2019 iron, 12 1/2 bah\u0101rs </li>\n<li>and 30 pounds; of these, two bah\u0101rs for 18 </li>\n<li>and the rest for 17 dinars. Proceeds: 220 </li>\n<li>dinars. The \u2018eggs\u2019 were selling badly. I sold </li>\n<li>a quantity {lit., \u2018weight\u2019} of three bah\u0101rs and 126 pounds, after the weighing</li>\n<li>and the defect, for the price of 99 dinars.His total credit: </li>\n<li>927 dinars.</li>\n<li>He owes for the rest of the freight of the pepper 30 f\u012bl\u012bs. Due him for pepper</li>\n<li>from K\u016blam priced at 28 1/2 [...]</li>\n</ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
